    "detailed_description": "Punch Jump is a Foddian Platformer, which means progress is difficult and not guaranteed.<br><br>The central mechanic is throwing around Carl, who is an NPC<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667240/extras/a7380b6687d479a3fdef7379b1876edb.poster.avif?t=1701305978\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667240/extras/a7380b6687d479a3fdef7379b1876edb.webm?t=1701305978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667240/extras/a7380b6687d479a3fdef7379b1876edb.mp4?t=1701305978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The goal of the game is to get him to the end of the level.<br><br>The art-style is minimalist and the in-game radio system plays a large variety of music from royalty-free authors.<br><br>The platforms and particles in the game flash to the beat of the music currently playing.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667240/extras/bfe5f841ba8f44a6b3b29229a187bdf3.poster.avif?t=1701305978\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667240/extras/bfe5f841ba8f44a6b3b29229a187bdf3.webm?t=1701305978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667240/extras/bfe5f841ba8f44a6b3b29229a187bdf3.mp4?t=1701305978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>If you are confident in your skills at platforming type games, then this game will humble you.<br><br><br>Join our Discord!<br>",
